# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF and the same file then differs
# between contributors on different platforms. The shell snippets in the README
# and any future scripts also break outright if they reach a Unix shell with
# CRLF endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
